sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: fleet maintenance redesign 2026-11-03 (one Tools phase shared with node:converge; 24 h / CVE version rule). Same shape as tool.install. docs/reference/tools.md#update-a-tool.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: tool:update
  %% kind: tool.update
  %% Pinned Debian downloads use native SSH curl exit codes for transport-only fallback, then verify the pin before publication.
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Node 12<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: tool:update 31
  %%> Command:
  %%> - `orbit tool:update 31`
  %%> - syntax: `<tool> [--repository=JSON] [--idempotency-key=KEY] [--json]`
  Note over GW: Validate, lock the Tool<br/>task #5134 · ripgrep on Node 12
  %%> Requirements:
  %%> - your Node has an access grant to Node 12
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-tool-write
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5134
  SW->>SW: Write the playbook input<br/>inventory · vars · known_hosts
  opt --repository
    SW->>SW: Verify the signing key<br/>fetch · fingerprint on 209
    %%> Why on 209:
    %%> - a wrong key stops the run before Node 12 is touched
  end
  SW->>N: Install Tools<br/>ansible · tags tools
  %%> Why the converge phase:
  %%> - an update is the same phase as an install, limited to this Tool
  %%> Version:
  %%> - the newest in the constraint that is at least 24 hours old, or fixes a known CVE
  SW->>N: Check the Tool<br/>ansible · tags check
  alt check passes
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded
    Note over GW: Record the version<br/>applied · unchanged
  else the update fails
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
    %%> On failure:
    %%> - the Tool keeps its old version when the package manager did not change it
    Note over GW: Mark the Tool failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5134
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
